      "tilemap_summary": "{\"id\":\"starraft_smugglercave\",\"type\":\"underground\",\"full_interpretation\":\"走私者石窟，地下洞窟，暗影教团巢穴，机关密布，封印共鸣圣晶碎片。\"}",
